---
import { SPECIALISTS } from "../data";
---

<section
  id="panel"
  class="border-y border-pz-line bg-pz-sand px-6 py-20 lg:py-28"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pz-clay-strong"
      >
        The panel
      </p>
      <h2
        class="mt-4 font-heading text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-4xl"
      >
        Ten specialists and one editor.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-pz-ink-soft">
        Each specialist has a written remit, a set of sources it works from, and
        a stated limit — what it won't do, and when it should hand you to a
        professional. The Chief of Staff decides who to ask, reconciles them when
        they disagree, and gives you one answer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-pz-line bg-pz-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {
        SPECIALISTS.map((s) => (
          <li class="bg-pz-paper p-6">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-pz-ink">
              {s.name}
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pz-ink-soft">{s.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
      <li class="flex flex-col justify-center bg-pz-clay-wash p-6 sm:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-pz-ink">
          Chief of Staff
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-pz-ink-soft">
          Routes the question, reads your family context first, and returns the
          synthesis: what to do, who informed it, and what to record as a
          decision.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-pz-ink-mute">
      Specialists summarize established guidance — NHS, NICE and the Lullaby
      Trust for UK families, with other national guidance noted where it differs.
      They are not clinicians, and they say so when a question needs one.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
